    "created_at": "2022-02-08T05:26:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-02-08T05:26:51Z",
    "body": "> I think we would have to run a deprecation process to do that. Not sure what the numbers look like. Its probably fine, though.\r\n\r\nAt least in Chrome we never shipped opaque origin support for BroadcastChannel, if that is what this is about? Not sure I fully understand why we shouldn't support opaque origins with BroadcastChannel though, there would be very few contexts that share the same opaque origin anyway...",
